.TH "pdf2dcm" 1 "Thu Jul 9 2026 18:43:40" "Version 3.7.0" "OFFIS DCMTK" \" -*- nroff -*-
.nh
.SH "نام (NAME)"
pdf2dcm \- Encapsulate PDF file into DICOM file format 
.PP

.SH "خلاصه دستور (SYNOPSIS)"
.PP
.PP
.nf
pdf2dcm [options] pdffile-in dcmfile-out
.fi
.PP
.SH "توضیحات (DESCRIPTION)"
.PP
The \fBpdf2dcm\fP tool is deprecated\&. Use \fBdcmencap\fP instead, which supports the same command line parameters, and more\&.
.SH "همچنین ببینید (SEE ALSO)"
.PP
